426055600253701402_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SFRVoiXBXyIQ7kNvwGHO3aE&_nc_oc=AdqIMmebIQ9gqd8eX30xWDewZLhiVnSmniHrTf7r9t7744bXeCLgDvxq-lg6Rxr6cLs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTSbh2Jea6TUKy6m5t1oMFCWpwTLyXK00jgGyBhDZeGkA&oe=6AFDC1E2"}, "display_name": "99 DROPS", "keywords": ["Parkour", "Action", "Gorilla", "Animal", "Beast"], "long_description": "**99 DROPS** is a brutal VR parkour challenge where dropping isn\u2019t failing \u2014 it\u2019s how you get better.\nJump risky gaps, balance on narrow platforms, and try not to drop into the lasers below.\nOne bad move, and down you go. But every drop sharpens your skills.\n-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n{1467674331083685}\n# Missed the jump? So what.\nTry, fail, repeat \u2014 that's the game.\n\n{712652821739348}\n# Each spotlight reveals a new trial.\nHow far can you go before you break?\n\n{1384316759292572}\n# Careful or reckless \u2014 your choice.\nThere's no wrong way to conquer the course.\n\n\n\n", "short_description": "99 DROPS is a brutal VR parkour challenge where dropping isn\u2019t failing \u2014 it\u2019s how you get better.\nJump risky gaps, balance on narrow platforms, and try not to drop into the lasers below.\nOne bad move, and down you go.\nBut every drop sharpens your skills.\nYou\u2019ll rage. You\u2019ll scream.  You\u2019ll get back up.\n\nCan you clear them all?"}]}, "developer_name": "Bit Bang Studio", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://univrs.jp/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://univrs.jp/terms-of-use/", "publisher_name": "UNIVRS, Inc.", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://univrs.jp/en/games", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id